{"4824880": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Design Studio Simulator: Print Your Empire", "steam_appid": 4824880, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your empire starts with one order.</h2><br>Design Studio Simulator: Print Your Empire puts you in charge of a real print-on-demand studio — from a spare bedroom setup with a basic iron to a full production studio serving dozens of clients. Every product you deliver, you designed yourself.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A real design editor, not a click-to-craft button</h2><br>Open your design workstation and create custom graphics for every order. Place text, add stickers, pick print zones, choose styles — then send it to production. The client asked for &quot;ska vibes on the back in black&quot;? That's on you to deliver.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Custom design editor with text, stickers, styles, and print zones<br><br></li><li> T-shirts, stickers, mugs, thermoses, caps, and more<br><br></li><li> Real order evaluation — clients notice if something's off<br><br></li><li> Reputation system — earn loyal regulars, lose careless mistakes<br><br></li><li> Walk-in customers, online orders via PrintGram, and free-mode designs to sell<br><br></li><li> Supply management — buy materials, track stock, plan deliveries</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow across eras</h2><br>Start in Era 1 with the basics. Unlock Era 2 with better equipment, a bigger space, and more demanding clients. Your studio evolves as your skills grow — each era feels like a new chapter.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Chill by design</h2><br>No punishing timers. No game over screen. Design Studio Simulator is built around creativity and satisfaction, not stress. Take your time on a design. Retry a bad order. Build your brand your way.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🛠️ Early Access</h2><br>Design Studio Simulator launches in Early Access with Era 1 and Era 2 fully playable. Active development continues — new products, new eras, and community feedback shape what comes next.<br><br><strong>Build your empire one order at a time.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your empire starts with one order.</h2><br>Design Studio Simulator: Print Your Empire puts you in charge of a real print-on-demand studio — from a spare bedroom setup with a basic iron to a full production studio serving dozens of clients. Every product you deliver, you designed yourself.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A real design editor, not a click-to-craft button</h2><br>Open your design workstation and create custom graphics for every order. Place text, add stickers, pick print zones, choose styles — then send it to production. The client asked for &quot;ska vibes on the back in black&quot;? That's on you to deliver.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Custom design editor with text, stickers, styles, and print zones<br><br></li><li> T-shirts, stickers, mugs, thermoses, caps, and more<br><br></li><li> Real order evaluation — clients notice if something's off<br><br></li><li> Reputation system — earn loyal regulars, lose careless mistakes<br><br></li><li> Walk-in customers, online orders via PrintGram, and free-mode designs to sell<br><br></li><li> Supply management — buy materials, track stock, plan deliveries</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow across eras</h2><br>Start in Era 1 with the basics. Unlock Era 2 with better equipment, a bigger space, and more demanding clients. Your studio evolves as your skills grow — each era feels like a new chapter.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Chill by design</h2><br>No punishing timers. No game over screen. Design Studio Simulator is built around creativity and satisfaction, not stress. Take your time on a design. Retry a bad order. Build your brand your way.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🛠️ Early Access</h2><br>Design Studio Simulator launches in Early Access with Era 1 and Era 2 fully playable. Active development continues — new products, new eras, and community feedback shape what comes next.<br><br><strong>Build your empire one order at a time.</strong></p>", "short_description": "You started with an iron, a spare room, and one friend's order. Now build the print empire you always imagined — design every product yourself, earn every client, grow every era.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4824880/caa7cea8f992c0425996c6caf6f0871e99374ab5/header.jpg?t=1787256009", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4824880/a890396d09fd0c6688f78cb46d72c561ebe8fc6a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787256009", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4824880/a890396d09fd0c6688f78cb46d72c561ebe8fc6a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787256009", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6500 / AMD Ryzen 5 1600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 960 / AMD RX 480 (4 GB VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-8700 / AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 / AMD RX 580 (6 GB VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</str